    <p class="w-[70ch] text-xl">
      The Nido Coding Club has been here for countless years; from being Girls
      who Code, to just a general coding club for everybody to join, the Nido
      Coding Club has gone through many changes and leaders today.<br /><br /> This
      2026-2027 school year, however, things will be different once again. Instead
      of being a club solely catered to those who already know how to code, we will
      assist the journey to learn coding and programming to those with zero experience,
      as coding remains one of the most in-demand skills today despite the overwhelming
      use of AI. Don't worry! We will oftentimes work alongside AI, whilst not completely
      overrelying on it, a.k.a. not vibecoding.<br /><br />Our end of school
      year project will be a website or app, or any real life technological
      solution to a problem that will put our skills to use (goal subject to
      change). We will also be offering to create and design tools and websites
      for other clubs upon request! :)
